✅ Benefits of VPN

Masks real public IP and location.

Encrypts all internet traffic, ensuring privacy.

Protects against ISP monitoring and Wi-Fi snooping.

Allows bypassing of geo-restrictions.

⚠️ Limitations of VPN

Can reduce browsing speed.

Free VPNs have limited servers and bandwidth.

Not complete anonymity (cookies, device fingerprinting still trackable).

Some websites block VPN IP ranges.

📌 Conclusion

Using ProtonVPN successfully showed how VPNs:

Change your public IP (103.151.114.11 → 185.177.125.173).

Encrypt traffic (verified in Wireshark with WireGuard packets).

Improve privacy and security with only minor speed trade-offs
